WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.407 --> 00:00:05.027
Type a request into the panel and press Send.

2
00:00:05.027 --> 00:00:10.821
Pellaeon picks the commands and ChimeraX runs them; the reply lists them.

3
00:00:10.821 --> 00:00:25.856
A question gets an answer in words.

4
00:00:25.856 --> 00:00:40.405
"it" is the structure you have open.

5
00:00:40.405 --> 00:00:46.241
The Undo button restores ChimeraX to how it was before the last request.

